Arch OS Recovery

  recovery    repair the Arch OS system on this machine

Add --debug for a run that changes nothing.

It keeps its answers in /opt/arch-os, so starting it again picks up where it
left off. What it did is in /opt/arch-os/recovery.log.

Reaching this prompt without asking for it means the Recovery stopped on its
own: journalctl -b -u arch-os says why.

